<title>THAILAND: Bangkok Investment pays 2 baht div for'96.</title>
<headline>Bangkok Investment pays 2 baht div for'96.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dividend for year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>			 Twelve months</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	  2.00	   vs	2.60</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 April 1, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment Date	May 23, 1997</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is Bangkok Investment Plc. It is a finance firm.</p>
<p>($1 = 26 baht)</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
